<title>USA: Sioux Falls cattle $0.50 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls cattle $0.50 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers moderately active. Early sales $0.50 higher than last Wednesday. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers:  High Select and Choice 2-3 1200-1350 lbs 64.50-67.00, mostly 64.50-66.00.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers:  High Select and Choice 2-3 1025-1200 lbs 64.50-65.50.</p>
</text>
